{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Silly's Gameshow is a co-op horror game where you and your friend are trapped in an old entertainment complex. Silly, a crazy animatronic host, forces you to play his deadly games. Team up to solve puzzles, dodge terrifying animatronics, and uncover the secrets of this haunted place. Every move is a risk\u2014can you escape before it\u2019s too late?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Key Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Co-op: Work together with a friend to survive Silly\u2019s challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Smart Animatronics: Face creepy robots that learn your moves and hunt you down.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fun Puzzles: Solve tricky puzzles to escape.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Spooky Setting: Explore a dark, rundown complex with eerie vibes and scary sounds.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Different Every Time: Randomized tasks and endings keep each game exciting.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3674050?t=1744909443","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3674050?t=1744909443","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3674050/e600dca2b3660f497c783fd2ff4e2a31def5414d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744909443","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3674050/e600dca2b3660f497c783fd2ff4e2a31def5414d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744909443","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Silly's Gameshow is a co-op horror game where you and your friend are trapped in an old entertainment complex. Silly, a crazy animatronic host, forces you to play his deadly game